{"title":"Career roadmap · Investment Analyst","role":"Investment Analyst","summary":"An Investment Analyst researches companies, industries, securities, markets and investment opportunities, then converts financial and non-financial information into structured investment recommendations. A B.Com Honours degree is a strong academic foundation, but students normally need additional skills in financial statement analysis, valuation, financial modelling, markets, economics, Excel and research to become competitive.","facts":{"Starts":"Year 1 UG · 2026","Current degree":"B.Com Honours","Timeline assumption":"4-year B.Com Honours pathway beginning in 2026, with graduation around 2030. If the student's university follows a different duration under its current programme structure, adjust the timeline accordingly."},"about":[{"label":"Career-route check","text":"B.Com Honours → Finance/Investment Internship → Investment Research / Equity Research / Financial Analyst role → Investment Analyst → Senior Investment Analyst → Portfolio Manager / Research Lead / Investment Strategist."},{"label":"Primary skills","text":"Accounting, finance, economics, valuation, financial modelling, Excel, research, statistics, communication"},{"label":"Strong complementary skills","text":"Python, SQL, Power BI, financial databases, AI-assisted research"}],"intro":[],"horizons":[{"period":"2026–2030","question":"What can I enter now?","output":"Finance intern, equity research intern, investment research intern, financial analyst trainee, credit/research intern"},{"period":"2030–2035","question":"How should I specialise?","output":"Investment Analyst, Equity Research Analyst, Credit Analyst, Investment Research Associate, FP&A/Corporate Finance Analyst"},{"period":"2035–2040","question":"How should I evolve?","output":"Senior Investment Analyst, Senior Research Analyst, Portfolio/Investment Specialist, Sector Specialist"},{"period":"2040–2046","question":"How can I remain relevant?","output":"Portfolio Manager, Research Lead, Investment Strategist, Investment Director, Chief Investment/Research roles"}],"sections":[{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Exact progression depends on employer, performance, qualifications, market cycle and whether the student enters equity research, asset management, private markets, wealth management, banking or another finance track."}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["When","Build this","Learn from","Proof of progress","Gap it moves"],"rows":[[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 1"},{"text":"Accounting + economics fundamentals"},{"text":"University curriculum, NPTEL","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Analyse one listed company's basic financial statements"},{"text":"Accounting literacy"}],[{"text":"Year 1 Sem 2"},{"text":"Excel + financial mathematics + business news reading"},{"text":"Microsoft Excel","url":"https://www.microsoft.com/microsoft-365/excel"},{"text":"Build an Excel financial-analysis workbook"},{"text":"Quantitative + digital skills"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 1"},{"text":"Corporate finance + financial statement analysis"},{"text":"University/NPTEL"},{"text":"Company financial statement analysis report"},{"text":"Financial analysis"}],[{"text":"Year 2 Sem 2"},{"text":"Valuation + capital markets"},{"text":"NPTEL + financial-market resources"},{"text":"DCF + comparable-company valuation"},{"text":"Investment research"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 1"},{"text":"Financial modelling + equity research"},{"text":"NPTEL + company annual reports"},{"text":"3-statement model + equity research report"},{"text":"Technical finance"}],[{"text":"Year 3 Sem 2"},{"text":"Internship + sector research + advanced valuation"},{"text":"Employer/research desk"},{"text":"Published-quality investment thesis"},{"text":"Industry readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 1"},{"text":"Specialisation + portfolio/research projects"},{"text":"Industry resources"},{"text":"3–5 complete investment reports"},{"text":"Job readiness"}],[{"text":"Year 4 Sem 2"},{"text":"Interview preparation + applications"},{"text":"Mock interviews + case studies"},{"text":"Finance portfolio + internship/job applications"},{"text":"Employability"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Core finance stack"},{"type":"h","text":"1. Accounting"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Double-entry accounting"},{"text":"Journal and ledger"},{"text":"Trial balance"},{"text":"Income statement"},{"text":"Balance sheet"},{"text":"Cash-flow statement"},{"text":"Notes to accounts"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Revenue recognition"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Receivables/payables"},{"text":"Provisions"},{"text":"Contingent liabilities"},{"text":"Consolidated financial statements"}]},{"type":"p","text":"An investment analyst must be able to look beyond reported profit and understand how the business actually generates and uses cash."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Financial statement analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to answer:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Is revenue growing sustainably?"},{"text":"Are margins improving?"},{"text":"Is cash flow supporting reported earnings?"},{"text":"Is debt increasing?"},{"text":"Is working capital becoming a problem?"},{"text":"What is driving ROE and ROCE?"},{"text":"Is the company generating economic value?"},{"text":"Are accounting assumptions materially affecting earnings?"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Important ratios:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"EBITDA margin"},{"text":"EBIT margin"},{"text":"Net profit margin"},{"text":"ROE"},{"text":"ROA"},{"text":"ROCE"},{"text":"Current ratio"},{"text":"Debt-to-equity"},{"text":"Interest coverage"},{"text":"Asset turnover"},{"text":"Inventory turnover"},{"text":"Receivable days"},{"text":"Payable days"},{"text":"Free cash flow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"3. Corporate finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Time value of money"},{"text":"NPV"},{"text":"IRR"},{"text":"Cost of capital"},{"text":"WACC"},{"text":"Capital structure"},{"text":"Dividend policy"},{"text":"Capital budgeting"},{"text":"Working-capital management"},{"text":"Business risk"},{"text":"Financial risk"},{"text":"M&A fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4. Valuation"},{"type":"p","text":"This is one of the most important technical areas."},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"h","text":"DCF"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue assumptions"},{"text":"Operating margins"},{"text":"Taxes"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Free cash flow"},{"text":"WACC"},{"text":"Terminal value"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Relative valuation"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"P/E"},{"text":"EV/EBITDA"},{"text":"EV/Sales"},{"text":"P/B"},{"text":"PEG"},{"text":"Dividend yield"},{"text":"Price/FCF"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Other approaches"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sum-of-the-parts"},{"text":"Precedent transactions"},{"text":"Asset-based valuation"},{"text":"Dividend discount model"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong student should be able to explain why a valuation is reasonable, not merely produce a valuation number."},{"type":"h","text":"Financial modelling stack"},{"type":"p","text":"The minimum practical stack should include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Financial modelling"},{"text":"3-statement modelling"},{"text":"DCF modelling"},{"text":"Comparable-company analysis"},{"text":"Sensitivity tables"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"},{"text":"Charts and dashboards"},{"text":"Annual-report extraction"},{"text":"Investment memo writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Later add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Python"},{"text":"pandas"},{"text":"NumPy"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Financial APIs/data platforms"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Python documentation · pandas · Microsoft Power BI","url":"https://docs.python.org/3/"},{"type":"h","text":"Investment research stack"},{"type":"p","text":"A student should learn how to research:"},{"type":"h","text":"Company"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business model"},{"text":"Revenue streams"},{"text":"Competitive advantage"},{"text":"Management"},{"text":"Capital allocation"},{"text":"Industry position"},{"text":"Growth drivers"},{"text":"Key risks"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Industry"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Market size"},{"text":"Growth rate"},{"text":"Competition"},{"text":"Regulation"},{"text":"Pricing power"},{"text":"Supply chain"},{"text":"Disruption risk"},{"text":"Cyclicality"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Macro"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Interest rates"},{"text":"Inflation"},{"text":"GDP growth"},{"text":"Currency"},{"text":"Commodity prices"},{"text":"Employment"},{"text":"Fiscal policy"},{"text":"Monetary policy"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Investment thesis framework"},{"type":"p","text":"Every serious company analysis should eventually answer:"},{"type":"h","text":"Investment thesis"},{"type":"p","text":"What makes this company attractive?"},{"type":"h","text":"Growth"},{"type":"p","text":"Where will future revenue and earnings growth come from?"},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"p","text":"Can the company earn attractive returns on capital?"},{"type":"h","text":"Valuation"},{"type":"p","text":"What is the business worth compared with its current price?"},{"type":"h","text":"Catalysts"},{"type":"p","text":"What could cause the market to reassess the company?"},{"type":"h","text":"Risks"},{"type":"p","text":"What could invalidate the thesis?"},{"type":"h","text":"Bear case"},{"type":"p","text":"What happens if the key assumptions fail?"},{"type":"h","text":"Conclusion"},{"type":"p","text":"What would make you change your view?"},{"type":"p","text":"This is much more valuable than simply writing “Buy” or “Sell.”"},{"type":"h","text":"Projects to build during B.Com Honours"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Complete company analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Select one listed company and prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Business overview"},{"text":"Industry analysis"},{"text":"5-year financial analysis"},{"text":"Ratio analysis"},{"text":"Management analysis"},{"text":"Competitive analysis"},{"text":"DCF"},{"text":"Comparable valuation"},{"text":"Risks"},{"text":"Investment thesis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — Three-statement financial model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Income Statement","Balance Sheet","Cash Flow Statement"]},{"type":"p","text":"with:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Historical financials"},{"text":"Forecast assumptions"},{"text":"Revenue forecast"},{"text":"Margin forecast"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Cash"},{"text":"Free cash flow"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — DCF valuation model"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical data","Forecast","FCF","WACC","Terminal Value","Enterprise Value","Equity Value","Fair Value"]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Bull case"},{"text":"Base case"},{"text":"Bear case"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 4 — Sector research report"},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one sector such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Banking"},{"text":"IT"},{"text":"Pharmaceuticals"},{"text":"FMCG"},{"text":"Automobile"},{"text":"Renewable energy"},{"text":"Insurance"},{"text":"Telecom"},{"text":"Consumer internet"},{"text":"Semiconductor"},{"text":"Infrastructure"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Compare 5–10 companies using financial and operating metrics."},{"type":"h","text":"Project 5 — Investment dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Use Excel or Power BI to track:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue growth"},{"text":"EBITDA margin"},{"text":"EPS"},{"text":"ROCE"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"FCF"},{"text":"P/E"},{"text":"EV/EBITDA"},{"text":"Market capitalisation"},{"text":"Share-price performance"}]},{"type":"h","text":"4-year honours variant"},{"type":"p","text":"If the university follows a four-year honours/research structure, use the additional year strategically rather than simply taking more general subjects."},{"type":"p","text":"Prioritise:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Advanced financial modelling"},{"text":"Investment research"},{"text":"Statistics/econometrics"},{"text":"Python for finance"},{"text":"Research methodology"},{"text":"Dissertation"},{"text":"Corporate finance"},{"text":"Portfolio management"},{"text":"Alternative investments"},{"text":"Financial risk"},{"text":"Internship/research project"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong honours dissertation could examine:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Factors affecting stock returns"},{"text":"Valuation of companies in a particular sector"},{"text":"Relationship between interest rates and equity markets"},{"text":"ESG and corporate valuation"},{"text":"Earnings quality"},{"text":"IPO performance"},{"text":"Financial ratios and bankruptcy risk"},{"text":"AI-assisted financial research"},{"text":"Volatility modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Lane","Core stack","Learn from","Senior role it leads to"],"rows":[[{"text":"Equity Research"},{"text":"Accounting + valuation + modelling + industry research"},{"text":"NPTEL + annual reports + research reports"},{"text":"Senior Equity Research Analyst"}],[{"text":"Asset Management"},{"text":"Portfolio theory + securities analysis + valuation"},{"text":"NPTEL + finance curriculum"},{"text":"Portfolio Manager"}],[{"text":"Credit Research"},{"text":"Financial statements + credit risk + debt markets"},{"text":"Finance/credit courses"},{"text":"Credit Research Lead"}],[{"text":"Investment Banking"},{"text":"Valuation + financial modelling + M&A"},{"text":"Corporate finance resources"},{"text":"Investment Banking Associate/VP"}],[{"text":"Private Equity"},{"text":"Valuation + due diligence + financial modelling"},{"text":"Finance + transaction case studies"},{"text":"Investment Professional"}],[{"text":"Wealth Management"},{"text":"Markets + asset allocation + client communication"},{"text":"Finance curriculum"},{"text":"Wealth/Investment Manager"}],[{"text":"FP&A"},{"text":"Financial analysis + budgeting + forecasting"},{"text":"Excel + corporate finance"},{"text":"FP&A Manager"}],[{"text":"Quant/Analytics"},{"text":"Statistics + Python + SQL + markets"},{"text":"NPTEL + Python resources","url":"https://nptel.ac.in/"},{"text":"Quant/Investment Analytics Specialist"}],[{"text":"ESG Investing"},{"text":"Sustainability + financial analysis + ESG metrics"},{"text":"Finance + sustainability resources"},{"text":"ESG Investment Specialist"}],[{"text":"FinTech Investment Research"},{"text":"Finance + data + Python + AI"},{"text":"Python + finance resources"},{"text":"FinTech Investment Analyst"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Evolve and stay relevant, 2035–2046"},{"type":"p","text":"Investment analysis is likely to become increasingly automated at the data collection, screening, summarisation and modelling-assistance levels. The analyst who remains valuable will combine financial judgement with technology."},{"type":"p","text":"Build toward:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI-assisted financial research"},{"text":"Automated financial-statement extraction"},{"text":"Alternative-data analysis"},{"text":"Python-based screening"},{"text":"Quantitative research"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"},{"text":"Portfolio analytics"},{"text":"Risk modelling"},{"text":"ESG analytics"},{"text":"Private-market analysis"},{"text":"AI-agent supervision"},{"text":"Data governance"},{"text":"Investment decision-making"}]},{"type":"p","text":"The goal should be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finance expertise","investment judgement","data","AI","communication."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Internships","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Government / public-sector / research exposure"},{"type":"table","header":["Organisation / ecosystem","Useful exposure"],"rows":[[{"text":"Reserve Bank of India (RBI)"},{"text":"Banking, monetary economics, financial markets, regulation and research"}],[{"text":"SEBI"},{"text":"Securities markets, investor protection and capital-market regulation"}],[{"text":"CAG"},{"text":"Public finance, financial audit and government accounts"}],[{"text":"Ministry/Department of Finance ecosystem"},{"text":"Public finance and economic policy"}],[{"text":"Public-sector banks"},{"text":"Credit, banking, financial analysis and operations"}],[{"text":"NITI Aayog"},{"text":"Economic and sector research"}],[{"text":"MoSPI"},{"text":"Economic/statistical research"}],[{"text":"University/IIT/IIM research groups"},{"text":"Finance, economics, econometrics and market research"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Use the official organisation websites to check current internship announcements; availability varies by year."},{"type":"p","text":"RBI · SEBI · CAG · NITI Aayog · MoSPI","url":"https://www.rbi.org.in/"},{"type":"h","text":"Private / industry"},{"type":"p","text":"Target:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Equity research firms"},{"text":"Asset management companies"},{"text":"Mutual fund companies"},{"text":"Investment banks"},{"text":"Brokerage firms"},{"text":"Wealth-management companies"},{"text":"FinTech companies"},{"text":"Credit-rating agencies"},{"text":"Corporate finance departments"},{"text":"Big Four transaction/advisory teams"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Examples include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Deloitte","url":"https://www.deloitte.com/"},{"text":"EY","url":"https://www.ey.com/"},{"text":"KPMG","url":"https://kpmg.com/"},{"text":"PwC","url":"https://www.pwc.com/"},{"text":"Grant Thornton","url":"https://www.grantthornton.global/"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best internship target"},{"type":"p","text":"For an aspiring Investment Analyst, prioritise internships where you actually perform:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Financial statement analysis","valuation","modelling","research","investment memo writing"]},{"type":"p","text":"over internships that only involve generic data entry or administrative finance work."}]},{"heading":"Certifications in demand","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Certification / learning path","Why it matters"],"rows":[[{"text":"CFA Program"},{"text":"Strong long-term investment-analysis pathway"}],[{"text":"NISM certifications"},{"text":"Useful for Indian securities-market knowledge and specific regulated-market roles"}],[{"text":"NPTEL Finance courses"},{"text":"Academic foundation"}],[{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Essential practical finance skill"}],[{"text":"Financial Modelling"},{"text":"Directly relevant to analyst work"}],[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Investment/management dashboards"}],[{"text":"Python for Finance"},{"text":"Automation and quantitative analysis"}],[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Financial and alternative-data analysis"}],[{"text":"Bloomberg Market Concepts / similar market-data training"},{"text":"Market-data familiarity, where accessible"}],[{"text":"Financial Risk Manager (FRM)"},{"text":"Useful for risk-oriented investment careers"}],[{"text":"CA/CMA/ACCA"},{"text":"Strong accounting/professional-finance route depending on career objective"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"CFA Institute · NISM · NPTEL","url":"https://www.cfainstitute.org/"},{"type":"note","label":"Important","text":"Do not collect certificates without building investment-analysis projects. For entry-level hiring, demonstrated modelling, research and analytical ability can be more useful than a long certificate list."},{"type":"p","text":"Certification fees and exam requirements should be checked on the official provider websites before enrolling."}]},{"heading":"Careers you can be hired as","kind":"careers","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"An Investment Analyst title is possible at entry level, but many graduates first enter through analyst, trainee, research or finance roles."},{"type":"h","text":"Realistic first-job titles"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Research Analyst"},{"text":"Equity Research Analyst"},{"text":"Equity Research Associate"},{"text":"Research Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Research Analyst"},{"text":"Credit Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Banking Analyst"},{"text":"Corporate Finance Analyst"},{"text":"Portfolio Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Investment Operations Analyst"},{"text":"Wealth Management Analyst"},{"text":"Asset Management Analyst"},{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Valuation Analyst"},{"text":"Financial Modelling Analyst"},{"text":"Business/Financial Research Associate"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Job-readiness matrix"},{"type":"table","header":["Role","Stack the posting asks for","Where the student proves it"],"rows":[[{"text":"Equity Research Analyst"},{"text":"Accounting + valuation + modelling"},{"text":"3 company research reports"}],[{"text":"Investment Analyst"},{"text":"Markets + valuation + research"},{"text":"Investment thesis portfolio"}],[{"text":"Financial Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + accounting + forecasting"},{"text":"Financial model"}],[{"text":"Credit Analyst"},{"text":"Accounting + credit analysis"},{"text":"Credit-risk case study"}],[{"text":"Investment Banking Analyst"},{"text":"Excel + valuation + M&A"},{"text":"DCF + transaction model"}],[{"text":"Portfolio Analytics Analyst"},{"text":"Finance + statistics + Excel/Python"},{"text":"Portfolio analytics project"}],[{"text":"Research Associate"},{"text":"Research + writing + analysis"},{"text":"Sector research report"}],[{"text":"Risk Analyst"},{"text":"Statistics + finance + risk"},{"text":"Risk dashboard/model"}],[{"text":"Valuation Analyst"},{"text":"DCF + comparable companies"},{"text":"Valuation model"}],[{"text":"Wealth Management Analyst"},{"text":"Markets + asset allocation"},{"text":"Model portfolio analysis"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Career reality"},{"type":"p","text":"A student does not need to become a portfolio manager immediately after B.Com. Portfolio management is normally a progression that requires substantial investment experience, strong research judgement and, depending on the activity and jurisdiction, applicable regulatory qualifications."}]},{"heading":"Postgraduate study in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["PG pathway","Best suited for"],"rows":[[{"text":"M.Com"},{"text":"Advanced commerce/accounting/finance"}],[{"text":"M.Com Finance"},{"text":"Finance-oriented academic route"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Finance"},{"text":"Quantitative and specialised finance"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Economics"},{"text":"Economics and market research"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Financial Economics"},{"text":"Economics + finance"}],[{"text":"MBA Finance"},{"text":"Investment banking, asset management, corporate finance"}],[{"text":"MBA Business Analytics"},{"text":"Finance + analytics"}],[{"text":"MBA FinTech"},{"text":"Finance + technology"}],[{"text":"M.Sc Data Science"},{"text":"Quantitative/financial analytics"}],[{"text":"M.A./M.Sc Economics"},{"text":"Research and economic analysis"}],[{"text":"PhD Finance"},{"text":"Academic/research career"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"Is a master's mandatory?"},{"type":"p","text":"No."},{"type":"p","text":"For many entry-level finance roles:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Honours","internship","financial modelling","valuation","Excel","research portfolio"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"can be sufficient to start a career."},{"type":"p","text":"A master's/MBA becomes more valuable when the student wants:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Investment banking"},{"text":"Asset management"},{"text":"Portfolio management"},{"text":"Quantitative finance"},{"text":"Higher-level corporate finance"},{"text":"Management progression"},{"text":"Academic/research careers"},{"text":"A stronger career switch"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Scholarships and research routes"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential routes include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PMRF — mainly relevant to eligible doctoral/research pathways"},{"text":"UGC fellowships"},{"text":"CSIR fellowships where the subject/eligibility fits"},{"text":"University-specific research assistantships"},{"text":"Institution-specific scholarships"},{"text":"Fulbright for eligible US study/research"},{"text":"DAAD for eligible German programmes"}]},{"type":"p","text":"PMRF · USIEF / Fulbright · DAAD India","url":"https://www.pmrf.in/"},{"type":"p","text":"Eligibility, funding amounts and programme-specific requirements must be checked for the exact year and programme."}]},{"heading":"Study abroad, country by country","kind":"abroad","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Country","Example universities / ecosystems","Scholarship route","Gate to check"],"rows":[[{"text":"USA"},{"text":"MIT, University of Chicago, NYU, Columbia, University of Pennsylvania"},{"text":"University funding, Fulbright and programme-specific scholarships"},{"text":"Quantitative prerequisites, fees, tests"}],[{"text":"UK"},{"text":"LSE, Oxford, Cambridge, Imperial, Warwick"},{"text":"Chevening + university scholarships"},{"text":"Programme prerequisites and funding"}],[{"text":"Germany"},{"text":"Mannheim, Frankfurt School, Goethe University, LMU Munich"},{"text":"DAAD + university funding"},{"text":"ECTS prerequisites and language"}],[{"text":"Canada"},{"text":"University of Toronto, UBC, McGill, Western"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Programme requirements and costs"}],[{"text":"Australia"},{"text":"University of Melbourne, UNSW, Monash, ANU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Entry requirements and finance curriculum"}],[{"text":"Singapore"},{"text":"NUS, NTU, SMU"},{"text":"University scholarships"},{"text":"Highly competitive admissions"}],[{"text":"France"},{"text":"HEC Paris, ESSEC, ESCP"},{"text":"University/government scholarships"},{"text":"Programme-specific requirements"}]]},{"type":"p","text":"University examples are illustrative, not a ranking. Exact programme names and admissions requirements must be verified for the intended intake."},{"type":"h","text":"Application pack"},{"type":"p","text":"Prepare:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Academic transcripts"},{"text":"CV"},{"text":"Statement of Purpose"},{"text":"Letters of Recommendation"},{"text":"English-language test if required"},{"text":"GMAT/GRE if required by the programme"},{"text":"Financial documentation"},{"text":"Internship certificates"},{"text":"Investment/finance project portfolio"},{"text":"Research/dissertation evidence"},{"text":"Passport and visa documents"}]}]},{"heading":"Going forward","kind":"growth","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career progression"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Com Honours Student","Finance / Investment Intern","Research / Financial Analyst / Investment Analyst","Investment Analyst / Equity Research Analyst","Senior Investment Analyst / Senior Research Analyst","Investment Specialist / Portfolio Manager / Research Lead","Investment Director / Head of Research / CIO-track role"]},{"type":"p","text":"Progression is not automatic. Portfolio-management and senior investment positions generally require demonstrated investment judgement, track record and relevant experience."},{"type":"h","text":"PhD routes"},{"type":"p","text":"A student interested in research or academia can pursue:"},{"type":"h","text":"Finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD Finance"},{"text":"PhD Investment Management"},{"text":"PhD Corporate Finance"},{"text":"PhD Financial Markets"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Economics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"PhD Economics"},{"text":"Financial Economics"},{"text":"Econometrics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Quantitative finance"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial Mathematics"},{"text":"Quantitative Finance"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Data Science"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Emerging research"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"AI in finance"},{"text":"Algorithmic investment research"},{"text":"Financial-market prediction"},{"text":"Alternative data"},{"text":"Sustainable finance"},{"text":"Behavioural finance"},{"text":"FinTech"},{"text":"Digital assets"},{"text":"Financial risk modelling"},{"text":"Explainable AI for investment decisions"}]},{"type":"h","text":"2035–2046 career evolution"},{"type":"p","text":"By the mid-2030s, routine financial-data collection and first-pass company screening will increasingly be assisted by AI and automated research systems."},{"type":"p","text":"A strong Investment Analyst should therefore move from:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Data collection","Analysis","Interpretation","Investment judgement","Strategic decision-making"]},{"type":"p","text":"The future profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Investment expertise","accounting","valuation","financial modelling","data analytics","AI","communication","judgement"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"An analyst who can combine traditional fundamental research with Python, alternative data, AI-assisted research and scenario modelling should remain substantially more adaptable than one who relies only on spreadsheet-based reporting."}]}]}